# CODEOWNERS — ADR-023 Phase 2 split (control plane).
#
# Two review authorities, by blast radius:
#   * PERIPHERY (routine work — work/**, product/**, docs/**, roadmap/**, most
#     of ledger/**, etc.) is reviewed by the machine account @scope-creep-review.
#     It is a Write (non-admin) USER, so it satisfies require_code_owner_reviews;
#     GitHub blocks it from approving its own PRs, so author != merger holds.
#   * ESCALATION SET (the core / safety rails / gate-enforcement surface) is
#     reviewed by the HUMAN Owner @dimays ONLY. The unattended reviewer identity
#     (@scope-creep-review, which runs in work-sweep) is deliberately NOT a code
#     owner for these paths, so it cannot self-dispose a change to the org's own
#     gates — the ADR-023 Phase-2 residual this split closes.
#
# CODEOWNERS = LAST matching pattern wins, so the escalation set is listed AFTER
# the periphery default and overrides it for those paths.
#
# (ADR-023 Phase 2; ADR-026; docs/owner-apply-work-sweep-unpause.md; work-117.)

# --- periphery default: routine review by the machine account ---
*                                       @scope-creep-review

# --- escalation set: HUMAN-ONLY Owner review (@dimays) ---
/charter/                               @dimays
/charter/INVARIANTS.md                  @dimays
/.claude/                               @dimays
/standards/                             @dimays
/agents/                                @dimays
/loops/                                 @dimays
/registry/                              @dimays
/.github/workflows/                     @dimays
/.github/CODEOWNERS                     @dimays
# gate scripts (ADR-026 residual: "the gate scripts", not just escalation-check)
/scripts/escalation-check*.sh           @dimays
/scripts/guard-*.sh                     @dimays
# ledger POLICY only — routine append entries stay periphery (NOT all of ledger/**)
/ledger/README.md                       @dimays
/scripts/routine-reviewer*              @dimays
/docs/owner-apply-routine-reviewer.md   @dimays
